  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e840cd99-59f6-4b27-b542-3023cd08bdfe.webp\" alt=\"服务器托管\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flullaby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/lullaby</a></p>\n<p>创建自己的服务器可能是一个非常漫长、繁琐且昂贵的过程。</p>\n<p>但通过 BisectHosting，您只需点击几下即可拥有自己的服务器！凭借他们的 24/7 支持和快速响应速度，任何问题都不会成为障碍！感兴趣吗？那我们有个优惠给您！</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>💌 捐赠</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flullaby45743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 Ko-Fi 上捐赠</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fpaypalme%252flucianobrumer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在 PayPal 上捐赠</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h1>枯萎附魔</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1327308441324097681?label=discord&color=blue&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fwithering-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/withering-enchantment-data-pack?label=modrinth&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/lullaby6/data-packs\" alt=\"许可证\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>针对剑的新 <code>枯萎</code> 附魔，对受害者施加枯萎效果。</p>\n<p>该附魔最高有 2 级，每增加一级，效果的持续时间也会增加。</p>\n<p>该附魔可以通过附魔台、宝箱 loot 或向村民交易获得。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>👾 Bug/问题</h2>\n<p>请在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a> 中报告任何问题/漏洞。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>⌨️ 命令</h2>\n<p>给予：</p>\n<pre><code>/loot give @s loot withering_enchantment:withering_&lt;等级&gt;</code></pre>\n<p>附魔：</p>\n<pre><code>/enchant @s withering_enchantment:withering &lt;等级&gt;</code></pre>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🪩 许可证</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/enchantments-data-pack/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AGPL-3.0-or-later</a></p>",
